---
import { WHY_CHOOSE_US } from '../data/company';
import { ArrowRight } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section id="keunggulan" class="py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-24 bg-industrial-900 text-white overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-6 sm:mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-3">
        Kualitas & Ketepatan Waktu
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-industrial-300 leading-relaxed">
        Kepastian mutu, akurasi takaran, dan kedisiplinan jadwal pengiriman sebagai standar mutlak setiap rit.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 sm:gap-6 mb-8 sm:mb-12">
      {WHY_CHOOSE_US.map((item) => (
        <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-6 bg-industrial-950">
          <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white mb-2">{item.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-sm text-industrial-300 leading-relaxed">{item.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="bg-industrial-950 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 items-center overflow-hidden">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 p-5 sm:p-8 lg:p-12 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white leading-snug">
          Batas Waktu Pengikatan Dua Jam
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-industrial-300 leading-relaxed">
          Reaksi hidrasi semen dimulai saat air bertemu semen. Waktu loading hingga penuangan dibatasi maksimal dua jam.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-industrial-300">
          <p>• Uji Slump Cone 12±2 cm sebelum penuangan.</p>
          <p>• Dilarang menambah air di lokasi tanpa instruksi teknis.</p>
          <p>• Pengambilan sampel benda uji silinder/kubus sesuai kesepakatan teknis.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a href="#kontak" class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-safety-600 hover:bg-safety-700 text-white font-bold text-xs transition-colors">
            <span>Hubungi Tim Teknis</span>
            <ArrowRight class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative h-48 sm:h-64 lg:min-h-[340px] overflow-hidden">
        <img 
          src="/images/testing-quality.jpg" 
          alt="Uji slump cone dan kuat tekan beton" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover brightness-90 contrast-105"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
